When you sensed a panicked terror coming from the pathologist, you felt blood raging in your veins and your stomach began to rumble. You suddenly burst into your beastly fur and muscle once again and caught the medical worker in the corridor. You attacked him from behind, pinning him down and biting through his throat in a blink of an eye. There wasn't much time. Half of the building must have heard his screams. After swallowing a few pieces of meat, you felt your strength quickly returning. On your way out, you scared a cleaning woman half to death, and finally left the building. Soon the pain abated. You was astonished to find out that your bullet wound had closed.